      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc01_0010_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "4FF119C5AFE061FA",
      "text": "那個地方，欸～……\\n如果沒有寶可夢聯盟或克拉韋爾校長批准，\\r\\n很難說能否去調查……[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
