      "label": "sdc01_0010_bbteacher_15",
      "hash64": "D36B5A83C78CC394",
      "text": "這我當然知道。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0042"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc01_0010_bbteacher_16",
      "hash64": "D36B5D83C78CC8AD",
      "text": "我已經申請好了，\\n期待能收到讓人滿意的回覆喔。[VAR 0x0114(0042)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
